Minor spoilers:


I'm not sure about armor, but I know that blessed scrolls and potions
will have either a greater positive effect, or less of a bad effect (a
potion of sickness won't harm you as much).  

Blessed weapons make it easier to hit undead monsters.

Hope this helps some.  I'm sure others can provide more detailed info.

